        "TileImage": "$($repository a23f4ad5-6857-4501-a53d-53522a671b88).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to New York, 47.\r\rOur target, Melissa Chien, is a senior executive at the Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank. She recently dismissed an employee whose years of meeting quotas apparently counted for little.\r\rHaving lost his livelihood, our client seeks a discreet... resolution. He hopes to finish packing before any investigation leads back to him.\r\rIt would seem the bank must part ways with Miss Chien.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
